control: The API server loads the policy of the accounts it serves, and of none when it serves none
removes: the policies' reload-failure series is registered on a registry the API server does not serve, so its metrics endpoint never carries the alarm's series
packages: ./api/app
tests: TestAFailedPolicyLoadStillFollowsTheList
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

